1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:05,466
Hello, it's DiGi. And here's Pebble.

2
00:00:06,816 --> 00:00:11,129
Oh, Pebble. Other way round. That's better.

3
00:00:12,479 --> 00:00:17,948
Let's breathe together. Breathe in, and blow out slowly.

4
00:00:17,948 --> 00:00:19,608
One more. Lovely.

5
00:00:20,958 --> 00:00:23,536
Today's special word is pretend.

6
00:00:24,336 --> 00:00:28,030
Pretend means made up. Not really happening.

7
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:36,035
Some things are real. A real puppy. Real rain. Real splashes.

8
00:00:37,385 --> 00:00:41,684
Some things are pretend. Dragons are pretend.

9
00:00:41,684 --> 00:00:45,410
Someone drew this one, to make a story.

10
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,604
And here's a tricky one.

11
00:00:48,604 --> 00:00:53,443
A computer can make a picture of something that never happened.

12
00:00:54,243 --> 00:00:59,909
This dog never went to the moon. A computer made the picture.

13
00:00:59,909 --> 00:01:02,509
It looks real, but it isn't.

14
00:01:03,859 --> 00:01:08,515
Sometimes you can't tell, just by looking. And that's okay.

15
00:01:08,515 --> 00:01:11,276
You don't have to know by yourself.

16
00:01:12,626 --> 00:01:18,001
Pause me here, and ask each other the question. I'll wait.

17
00:01:22,451 --> 00:01:26,797
So when you're not sure, ask the magic question.

18
00:01:27,597 --> 00:01:28,559
Is this real?

19
00:01:29,909 --> 00:01:33,664
Take it to your grown up and ask: is this real?

20
00:01:33,664 --> 00:01:35,661
Then look at it together.

21
00:01:37,011 --> 00:01:44,193
Let's play. Real, pretend, or made by a computer? Shout it out.

22
00:01:45,543 --> 00:01:47,913
The puppy in the puddle?

23
00:01:49,913 --> 00:01:51,437
Real!

24
00:01:52,787 --> 00:01:53,545
The dragon?

25
00:01:55,545 --> 00:01:56,263
Pretend!

26
00:01:57,613 --> 00:01:58,817
The dog on the moon?

27
00:02:00,817 --> 00:02:04,265
Made by a computer. Ooh, tricky.

28
00:02:05,615 --> 00:02:11,389
The clever thing isn't knowing. The clever thing is asking.

29
00:02:12,739 --> 00:02:17,443
Pause me here. Say it together, and do your high five.

30
00:02:21,893 --> 00:02:24,962
You will never be in trouble for asking.

31
00:02:24,962 --> 00:02:27,187
Grown ups love that question.

32
00:02:28,537 --> 00:02:33,282
So. Some things are real. Some are pretend.

33
00:02:33,282 --> 00:02:36,813
And some are made by a computer.

34
00:02:38,163 --> 00:02:42,508
And if you're not sure, ask. Is this real?

35
00:02:43,858 --> 00:02:50,318
Tonight, if you see something amazing on a screen, ask your grown up:

36
00:02:50,318 --> 00:02:51,535
is this real?

37
00:02:52,335 --> 00:02:55,855
Goodbye from DiGi. See you next time.
